name invoice2
category Package
revision 67327
shortdesc Intelligent invoices with LaTeX3
relocated 1
longdesc Typeset invoices with automatic VAT and calculation of totals.
longdesc Supports internationalization, invoices are typeset with
longdesc booktabs for readability. Does not support separate projects
longdesc per invoice. Can be used as a replacement for invoice in most
longdesc cases.
depend booktabs
depend l3kernel
depend l3packages
depend siunitx
depend siunitx
depend tools
depend translations
depend xcolor
runfiles size=7
 RELOC/tex/latex/invoice2/invoice2-english.trsl
 RELOC/tex/latex/invoice2/invoice2-german.trsl
 RELOC/tex/latex/invoice2/invoice2-swissgerman.trsl
 RELOC/tex/latex/invoice2/invoice2.sty
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/no-preserve-root/invoice2
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/invoice2
catalogue-license gpl3+
catalogue-topics invoice
